# Clean-room and trademarks

- Do not use the 2024 Winamp source drop, or anything copied from it.
- Do not add Nullsoft’s base skin or any third-party `.wsz` to the repo or the app bundle.
- Do not copy Webamp, Llammp, or another player’s source into this tree. Reading published format notes and Webamp for behavior is allowed. Pasting their code is not.
- “Winamp” appears only as “compatible with classic Winamp skins.” Not in the product name, bundle id, or menu-bar label.
- YouTube, SoundCloud, DRM circumvention, and scraping lyric or music APIs are out. Do not reopen them.
- Our license is MIT OR Apache-2.0. Do not add FFmpeg or `fdk-aac`.
- Details: `docs/LEGAL.md`.
